  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Luc baut Äpfel, Birnen und Walnüsse an. Neben seinem Obst bietet er auch Cidre, Suppen, Gelees, Fruchtsaft, Marmelade und Kompott an. Ohne Konservierungsstoffe."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Luc Molliere is a fruit farmer in fourth generation.  In his own words he knew already as a small child that he will continue farming fruits as a grown up. And it is true, that in his garden you can really sense a French traditional family farm with animals running around and parents helping with everyday tasks. Lucs farm is producing apples, pears, walnuts, strawberries, cereals, and also charolais beef."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Luc coltiva mele, pere e noci. Oltre alla frutta, produce anche sidro, zuppe, gelatine, succhi di frutta, marmellate e composte. Senza conservanti."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Luc cultive des pommes, des poires et des noix. En plus de ses  fruits, il propose aussi du cidre, des soupes, des gelées, du jus de fruits, de la confiture et de la compote. Sans conservateurs."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Luc kweekt appels, peren en noten. Naast zijn fruit biedt hij ook cider, soepen, gelei, vruchtensap, jam en compote aan. Geen conserveringsmiddelen."
    ],
    "es": [
      "Luc cultiva manzanas, peras y nueces. Además de su fruta, también elabora sidra, sopas, jaleas, zumos de fruta, mermeladas y compotas. Sin conservantes."
    ]
  },
